# A loaded word mod 8 compared `gt` 7 and `ge` 0: the remainder's range
# [0, 7] decides both, so the first store runs on no thread, its `setp`
# unused, and the second on every thread; the third store's address
# shows the remainder as `uniform(…) mod 8`.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/uniform_mod_range.ptx | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
ANN: {{^}}	setp.gt.u32 	%p1, %r2, 7; // unused{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	@%p1 st.global.u32 	[%rd1+4], %r2; // no thread | exec 0/CTA | global store [param_0 + 4] sectors/req 0 (ideal 0){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	@%p2 st.global.u32 	[%rd1+8], %r2; // global store [param_0 + 8] sectors/req 1 (ideal 1){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd3+16], %r2; // global store [4·(uniform(%r1@{{[0-9]+}}) mod 8) + param_0 + 16] sectors/req 1 (ideal 1){{$}}
